# Project Title: sILENT AUCTION

## Description

This code is used to start a silent auction program which will help a group of users to place their bids for an item on sale without knowing how much someone else had placed.

### Dependencies

optional: ASCII_Art.py - this script has the logo for the auction. Not mandatory but adds a little bit of flavour to the mix.

### Installations Needed

NA

